Chapter: Network
 The Network effect provides fetch, post, and resolve-dns.
 To fetch gives the Text response body for the given URL.
 To post gives the Text response body after sending a payload to the given URL.
 To resolve-dns gives the Text address for the given hostname.
 We say:
Section: Definitions
  effect Network where
    fetch       : Text -> [Network.Read] Text
    post        : Text, Text -> [Network.Write] Text
    resolve-dns : Text -> [Network.Read] Text
